              "shortDescription": {
                "markdown": "CVE-2026-23745: node-tar is Vulnerable to Arbitrary File Overwrite and Symlink Poisoning via Insufficient Path Sanitization",
                "text": "CVE-2026-23745: node-tar is Vulnerable to Arbitrary File Overwrite and Symlink Poisoning via Insufficient Path Sanitization"
